mes_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 787, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 787, "last_played": 1638300574, "avatar": "ac713663846f86c2f49becbab41fa91c6944c88d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I thought this would be a survival/endless digging game with combat and randomly generated mines/caves, maybe even some crafting.\n \nBut instead: \n-Grind quests and season pass. Also if you play with friends, both get different quests and quest zones, making playing together kinda useless.\n-Most game modes are Linear. \n-Little to no point for exploration or even mining itself. Gold is useless, only good for cosmetics. That other thing you mine for ammo drops, you don't need very much of it. \n-For a mining game, theres very little variety in minerals that you mine. \n-Combat is mediocre, weapons have little to no impact. Also not a lot of weapon variety. \n-All enemies are very similar in terms of what their weakness is. Just circle them, and  shoot in the back..like 90% of the enemies. \n-Perk tree is super boring and almost pointless. Its neither fun or useful.\n\nAm i missing something here? Why is this game so over hyped? Very mediocre game.", "timestamp_created": 1638315566, "timestamp_updated": 1638315566, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.422178089618682861", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "104909292", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009337303", "personaname": "The Bearded Plush", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BeardedPlush/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 15759, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12904, "last_played": 1651605071, "